<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Taliban forces continue confronting Pakistani security troops along the Kurram border while Pakistan has halted trade at two Iran crossings, affecting the Zangali checkpost and Torkham operations. The United Nations warns Afghanistan is one step away from famine and the Taliban-opened road to China faces security hurdles. Pakistan has warned of further action if Afghan soil is used for attacks and a militant overseeing Pakistani Taliban financial operations was killed. Traffic has doubled at the Afghanistan-Iran border after 24‑hour operations began, and a strong earthquake struck the Afghanistan-Pakistan border region. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168631&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFB5cmFRdHYxUjlhTDlIZ1laSTk1a21DUzVlcTBLQUpTY0NuY01XOU5DS21QUENDaGRWalBsb0Zha1diNUd3UDBfVA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaEdOMTREYVE2LV9VUVg4bl95OHhyZ1VFamwyeUVoLWY2RTNCLUkwNTZGYUdJbVZXVW5GR18wS21pNWFIUldHUmJCRHZ6THI2NnI4Zi1ITmFsdmtoSU9raFY4ZjI0bk9FTHhtRkhVd0VQenJINDZsSU16S3dPX1hpMkZaR3E4UHhTcTNBamdOQ1FQX1lETG5za3YzeXU0aGVlaGFhNlNLdTJEVDZja1JWRUc2eXhqS3FGZWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPX2RfTS1LeFJUYkc4WTJoaDdveGFzSWpjSzNQZXZadWd2Z0xoeG9mN0EwakVrcjZxU2hfM0c5cTFWSi00Z01XWXY3WWRjUWNxOW1SaFFRdmZhWVd5UE9vSHU0Smtabk9sR0VJLVpJd0FZaUtiWHBNeVg3eF9IYTNucUhQeHlTbmxvNnVVYjByQkNZc3RmckpHengxLXNtUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation (Pakistan )&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBDODhfNHk4SHZpdEVhcjRnRHVFSFcyVGJCTHFIU19zWjVlS0JFMFVkV25fWFdFWUVkV1NsR1NtTUtWa1N4aWdIUjZDVXV0aGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekabultri